{"locales":{"en":{"D4SYEqi7s6":{"heading_html":"INTRODUCING THE MOST VERSATILE QUICK TWIST<div>SYSTEM.<\/div>"},"32y2fbid516":{"heading_html":"INTRODUCING THE MOST VERSATILE QUICK TWIST<div>SYSTEM.<\/div>"},"3jsnmttgcz2":{"lh_y7xw7x_title":"PREMIUM QUICK TWIST FILTERS","lh_y7xw7x_des_html":"Metpure Versatile series consists of top tier quick-twist style filters. These proprietary cartridges are designed to be installed and replaced without the need for any tools. Simply twist and turn for a fast, easy, and convenient filter replacement experience. No more need to hire and pay expensive technicians or purchase filter wrenches to replace traditional water filters that are so difficult to change.&nbsp;<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_y7xw7w_title_html":"<br>COMPACT &amp; EASY TO INSTALL","lh_y7xw7w_des_html":"This sleek and space-saving solution effortlessly enhances any kitchen aesthetic, providing not only purified water but also a touch of sophistication. The user-friendly installation ensures a hassle-free setup, allowing you to enjoy the benefits of filtered water in no time. Crafted with precision and attention to detail, the Metpure Versatile system strikes the perfect balance between form and function<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_y7xw7v_title_html":"<br><br> CUSTOMIZABLE","lh_y7xw7v_des_html":"A customizable water filtration system allows users to tailor the filtration process according to their specific water purification needs, enabling the addition or removal of stages based on the unique composition of the water source. With its adaptable configuration, this system provides the flexibility to adjust the filtration capacity, water flow rate, and the types of filters used, ensuring optimal water quality for diverse applications and preferences. <br>\n<br><br><!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_y7xw7u_title":"All PARTS INCLUDED","lh_y7xw7u_des_html":"Every pre-packaged Metpure Versatile water filtration system comes with all parts, so you don't have to spend the extra time and money to purchase them separately. Designed for adaptability, it comes equipped with all necessary components for a hassle-free installation experience.&nbsp;<!--lh-live-editor-->"},"mbkrbkykue":{"lh_a168_title":"QUICK TWIST TECHNOLOGY","txt":"STEP","lh_9wid92_title":"QUICK TWIST","lh_9wid92_desc_html":"The quick twist filter design makes the filter replacement process easy, fast, and convenient without the mess, stress and fuss. Its intuitive installation method ensures that even those unfamiliar with filter replacements can effortlessly maintain their system.&nbsp;<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_a5w0bb_title":"CARTRIDGE ATTACHMENT MANIFOLD (CAM)","lh_a5w0bb_desc_html":"The filter head, or CAM, is equipped with an built-in water shut-off valve mechanism that automatically shut-off water during filter replacement,  so there is no need to shut-off water supply when replacing filters, making the filter change process easy and worry-free.  Its patented leak-free design guarantees secure connection, enhancing reliability. Plus, tool-free filter replacement makes maintenance effortless, catering to end-user friendly operation.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_af9ndk_title_html":"DOUBLE O-RING AND ROBUST TWIST-IN KEYS\n&nbsp;","lh_af9ndk_desc_html":"This mechanical component boasts leak-proof performance with its double O-ring design and robust twist-in keys, ensuring secure locking. With burst pressure capabilities up to 460 PSI, it guarantees reliability and durability, ideal for applications requiring tight seals and locking mechanisms.<!--lh-live-editor-->","btn":"BUY IT NOW FOR ONLY $24"},"tak0djipxko":{"heading_html":"LARGE SELECTION OF&nbsp; REPLACEMENT FILTERS<div><br><\/div>"},"1sxysms4onn":{"heading":"LARGE SELECTION OF REPLACEMENT FILTERS"},"qyil9j28jn":{"lh_up5omg_wishlist":"Add To Wishlist","lh_up5omg_quickview":"Quick View","lh_fe0dna_text":"Add To Cart","lh_aod0fu_text":"SOLD OUT","lh_rv7qtl_text":"NEW","lh_k191aj_heading":"SHOP ALL METPURE VERSATILE FILTERS"},"u5hfdaz