-rating span {\n            color: #ffd700; \/* Set the color of the stars *\/\n        }\n    <\/style>\n<\/head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"star-rating\">\n    <span>&#9733;<\/span>\n    <span>&#9733;<\/span>\n    <span>&#9733;<\/span>\n    <span>&#9733;<\/span>\n    <span>&#9733;<\/span>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/body>\n<\/html><!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_92gzf6_pos":"Customer","lh_92gzf6_content_html":"Excellent product \nIt is easy to install good taste on the water love the product I will recommend to family and friends. <br> \n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Five-Star Rating<\/title>\n    <style>\n        .star-rating {\n            font-size: 24px;\n        }\n\n        .star-rating span {\n            color: #ffd700; \/* Set the color of the stars *\/\n        }\n    <\/style>\n<\/head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"star-rating\">\n    <span>&#9733;<\/span>\n    <span>&#9733;<\/span>\n    <span>&#9733;<\/span>\n    <span>&#9733;<\/span>\n    <span>&#9733;<\/span>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/body>\n<\/html><!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_92gzf7_pos":"Customer","lh_92gzf7_content_html":"I've upgraded my Watts to this Metpure RO water filtration system. The tools they provide were very handy for installing the faucet. The fact the faucet doesn't have an air gap has also made it much easier to install. The filter is quiet as compared to my old Wattss system. Overall the water taste great! Filters are at a reasonable price as well.   <br>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Five-Star Rating<\/title>\n    <style>\n        .star-rating {\n            font-size: 24px;\n        }\n\n        .star-rating span {\n            color: #ffd700; \/* Set the color of the stars *\/\n        }\n    <\/style>\n<\/head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"star-rating\">\n    <span>&#9733;<\/span>\n    <span>&#9733;<\/span>\n    <span>&#9733;<\/span>\n    <span>&#9733;<\/span>\n    <span>&#9733;<\/span>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/body>\n<\/html><!--lh-live-editor-->"},"phYHc6b50M":{"heading":"Frequently Asked Questions","lh_ku5mxb_title":"How are the Metpure Versatile quick twist filter systems different than other quick twist systems?","lh_ku5mxb_content_html":"Our systems are equipped with quick twist filters that can be replaced with ease without any required tools. One of the main differences in our Metpure versatile quick twist systems is that the open design allows for easy troubleshoot, part replacement, and customization. Also, due to this open design concept, we can customize the Metpure Versatile systems to suite many different water filtration needs.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ku5mxa_title":"How big is the typical Metpure Versatile water filtration system?","lh_ku5mxa_content_html":"Our systems, given similar specs as other systems, take up typically up to 3 times LESS space than our competitors. Combined with our low-profile quick twist filters and open design concept, we are able to design our systems to be much more compact while achieving superior water filtration functions and effectiveness. <!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ku5mx9_title":"How often should the filters be replaced?","lh_ku5mx9_content_html":"Filter life span depends heavily on usage, water quality, water pressure, and the type of filters being replaced. Typically, pre-filters can last between 6-12 months, and reverse osmosis membranes can last 2-4 years.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ku5mx8_title":"What does the Metpure Versatile system come with?","lh_ku5mx8_content_html":"All pre-packaged systems come with all the required parts for installation, such as tubings, faucet, valves, fittings, tanks, etc, so you don\u2019t have to worry about getting parts separately, costing you extra time and money.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ku5mx7_title":"What is the warranty on the system?","lh_ku5mx7_content_html":"All our Metpure Versatile systems come with a 1-year manufactured warranty + 1 additional year upon system registration.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ku5mx6_title":"Are the Metpure Versatile systems easy to be installed?","lh_ku5mx6_content_html":"The systems come with a detailed instructional manual and installation videos that can be easily followed step-by-step. Only basic tools are required to install the system. Many first time users and installed find our systems very easy to install.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ku5mx5_title":"How do I know which system is right for me?","lh_ku5mx5_content_html":"We detail and list every system and its filter specifications with as much information as possible. Please read through the listing of each system and determine which one suites your need the best. Or contact our customer support at support@metpure.com or call us at 714-202-0019.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ku5mx4_title":"How do you customize the Metpure Versatile systems?","lh_ku5mx4_content_html":"We can customize the system to your specification with the existing filters and parts available. If you are a business or reseller and would like to private label the Metpure Versatile systems, contact our customer support at support@metpure.com or call us at 714-202-0019 for more information.<!--lh-live-editor-->"},"nvi80nb74un":{"lh_up5omg_outstock":"Out of stock","lh_up5omg_new":"New","lh_up5omg_sale":"Sale","lh_k4hsr9_out":"Sold out","lh_hifzh_title_html":"MV4 WATER FILTRATION SYSTEMS&nbsp;"}}},"name":"Water Filtration Syste"}
